I board the bus.
This is a BEST bus.
There is a lot of crowd in the bus.
I find an empty seat.
I sit there.
The conductor comes towards me.
I ask him, 'Dada, which is the stop for Marine Drive?'
Conductor dada says, 'Get down at the Marine Lines stop.'
He further says, 'Then go straight towards the sea.'
I ask, 'And then?'
He says, 'Then turn left.'
I ask him, 'Is the stop near?'
He says, 'Yes, it is very near.'
I take my ticket.
I say to him, 'Thank you, dada.'
Conductor dada goes forward.
The bus goes towards the next stop.
I look outside through the window.
